                              "cleanSource":  "\u0026GridPageSize = Grid.Rows\n  \u0026GAMRole.Load(\u0026RoleIdAux)\n\tIf not \u0026FilName.IsEmpty()\n\t\t\u0026Filter.Name\t= !\"%\" + \u0026FilName\t\n\tElse\n\t\t\u0026Filter.Name\t= !\"%\" + \u0026SearchFilter\n\tEndif\t\n\t\u0026Filter.ExternalId \t= !\"%\" + \u0026FilExternalId\n\t\u0026Roles = \u0026GAMRole.GetChildren(\u0026Filter, \u0026Errors)\n\tIf \u0026Roles.Count = 0\n\t\t\u0026GridPageCount = 0\n\tElse\n\t\t\u0026GridPageCount = (\u0026Roles.Count/\u0026GridPageSize) + iif(Mod(\u0026Roles.Count, \u0026GridPageSize) \u003e 0, 1, 0)\n\tEndIf\n\t\u0026GridRecordCount = \u0026Roles.Count\n\tFor \u0026Role in \u0026Roles\n\t\t\u0026Id\t  = \u0026Role.Id\n\t\t\u0026Name = \u0026Role.Name\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [Start] - Do not change */\n\t//this code should be inside the For Each used to load the data\n\t\n\t//Sample conditions to be added manually:\n\t//Where \u003cAttribute\u003e like \u0026FilName when not \u0026FilName.IsEmpty()\n\t//Where \u003cAttribute\u003e like \u0026FilExternalId when not \u0026FilExternalId.IsEmpty()\n\t\n\t\u0026Update = !\u0027\u003ci class=\"fa fa-pen\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u0027\n\tIf (\u0026IsAuthorized_Update)\n\t\t\u0026Update.Link = GAMRoleEntry.Link(GAMAPiMode.Update, \u0026Id)\n\tEndif\n\t\u0026Delete = !\u0027\u003ci class=\"fa fa-times\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u0027\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [End] - Do not change */\n\tGrid.Load()\n\t\n\tEndFor"
